# Community-maintained list of Iranian mirrors (source: the Mirava project, https://github.com/MiravaOrg/Mirava).
# NOTHING here is guaranteed to work or to stay online. Test from YOUR server:  sudo tikootak mirrors test
# Edit freely. Format:   docker URL   |   npm URL   |   apt HOST   (HOST = name only, no https://)
# Docker registry mirrors (pull-through caches: they only serve images somebody already pulled through them)
docker https://docker.arvancloud.ir
docker https://docker.mobinhost.com
docker https://docker.iranserver.com
docker https://docker.iranrepo.ir
docker https://registry.docker.ir
docker https://mirror-docker.runflare.com
docker https://docker.kernel.ir
docker https://focker.ir
docker https://mirror2.chabokan.net
docker https://mirror.atlantiscloud.ir
# npm registries (only needed when the gateway image is BUILT on the server; the offline kit does not need npm)
npm https://registry.npmmirror.com
npm https://package-mirror.liara.ir/repository/npm
npm https://registry.npmjs.org
# Debian/Ubuntu package mirrors (full mirrors: they keep working when the international link is down)
